# Flutter workspace runtime data (HiveWorkspaceService)
# Principal-scoped workspace dirs created under the CWD by tests (and under
# the app documents dir in production). Contains Hive boxes + encrypted
# attachment files; must never be committed.
mobile/workspaces/

# Supabase local runtime state; migration SQL remains tracked.
supabase/.branches/
supabase/.temp/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Policy corpus — DO NOT REDISTRIBUTE the source documents.
# corpus_global/ and corpus_lob/ hold real, publicly-posted policy wordings and
# regulator forms. Insurer wordings are COPYRIGHTED and must stay local (eval
# only) — see corpus_global/NOTICE.md. The manifest, NOTICE, gold-label specs
# and coverage datasets ARE tracked (they are our own analysis / URLs), but the
# downloaded PDFs and quarantined bot-block HTML are NOT. Re-download via
# tools/scrape_policy_corpus.py.
corpus_global/**/*.pdf
corpus_global/**/*.blocked.html
corpus_lob/*.pdf


# Agent/tool runtime state (hook baselines contain secret-like strings; never publish)
.mimosa/

# Raw Codex audit transcripts (large, may echo file contents) — keep the .md reports, not the logs
docs/audits/**/_codex_logs/
